==================================================\
16. BROWSE PRODUCTS\
==================================================\
\
Route:\
\
/browse\
\
Purpose:\
Display the complete product catalogue.\
\
Features:\
- Search\
- Category filtering\
- Sorting\
- Product list/grid\
- Price\
- Availability\
- Product details navigation\
\
Desktop can use a terminal-style table.\
\
Example:\
\
$ ls products\
\
ID   NAME                 CATEGORY       PRICE       STATUS\
01   Product A            Design         $29         AVAILABLE\
02   Product B            Development    $49         AVAILABLE\
03   Product C            Marketing      $19         AVAILABLE\
\
On mobile, convert the table into responsive stacked cards.\
\
Do not force a desktop table onto small screens.\
\
