==================================================\
25. RESPONSIVE DESIGN\
==================================================\
\
The interface must be fully responsive.\
\
Desktop:\
- Persistent sidebar for authenticated marketplace pages\
- Main terminal workspace\
- Wide tables where appropriate\
\
Mobile:\
- No oversized desktop sidebar\
- Use compact terminal-inspired mobile navigation\
- Convert tables into cards/lists\
- Maintain readable typography\
- Maintain comfortable touch targets\
- Avoid horizontal scrolling wherever possible\
\
The terminal aesthetic must remain intact on mobile.\
\
==================================================\
26. AUTHENTICATION-AWARE NAVIGATION\
==================================================\
\
Unauthenticated user:\
\
Show:\
\
Home\
Products\
About\
How It Works\
FAQ\
Contact\
Login\
Register\
\
Authenticated user:\
\
Show:\
\
Home\
Browse\
My Purchases\
Account\
Payment\
Support\
Logout\
