==================================================\
32. FINAL DESIGN OBJECTIVE\
==================================================\
\
The final product should feel like:\
\
"A premium digital marketplace accessed through a beautifully designed terminal interface."\
\
It should NOT feel like:\
- A fake hacker website\
- A command-line toy\
- A generic SaaS dashboard\
- An over-designed cyberpunk template\
\
The user should immediately understand:\
\
1. What the platform does\
2. What products are available\
3. How purchasing works\
4. How to create an account\
5. How payment works\
6. How their account becomes active\
7. How to get support\
\
while still feeling like they are inside a sophisticated terminal environment.\
\
Build the UI system consistently across all pages and make the components reusable.}